{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1031489-aggravated-damage-and-reach","id":1031489,"title":"aggravated damage and Reach","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-14T00:24:16-08:00","id":1031489,"title":"aggravated damage and Reach","content":"Hi there, new to the forum mostly to ask this question. My character is a mastigos, currently having Space 4, Mind 3, Prime 3 , Matter 3 Spirit 2 and Force 1. I currently have quite a bit of experience point collected and was wondering wich arcanum to buy next, my storyteller suggested to get my second ruling arcanum to 4 and told me to check the &quot;spellbook&quot; to give me and idea of it.<br /> <br /> So I did, and saw that the spell Mind flay required 2 reach and a mana to do aggravated damage, went ahead and check back with space for Collapse to find out it only need 1 reach and 1 mana, Kinda confused, I started looking at other arcanum to eventually find out they all only require 1 reach and mana except for mind.<br /> <br /> My question is now this : Why is it that mind need 2 reach to do the same damage as all other arcanum can do with a single reach? Does any one have any idea about it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12871-elggur","name":"Elggur","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-14T01:43:47-08:00","id":1031497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elggur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1031489-aggravated-damage-and-reach#post1031489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi there, new to the forum mostly to ask this question. My character is a mastigos, currently having Space 4, Mind 3, Prime 3 , Matter 3 Spirit 2 and Force 1. I currently have quite a bit of experience point collected and was wondering wich arcanum to buy next, my storyteller suggested to get my second ruling arcanum to 4 and told me to check the &quot;spellbook&quot; to give me and idea of it.<br /> <br /> So I did, and saw that the spell Mind flay required 2 reach and a mana to do aggravated damage, went ahead and check back with space for Collapse to find out it only need 1 reach and 1 mana, Kinda confused, I started looking at other arcanum to eventually find out they all only require 1 reach and mana except for mind.<br /> <br /> My question is now this : Why is it that mind need 2 reach to do the same damage as all other arcanum can do with a single reach? Does any one have any idea about it?</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe that's because all of the others attack the physical body, whereas Mind Flay is psychic damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-14T03:33:20-08:00","id":1031519,"title":"","content":"It could also just be a typo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-14T20:15:26-08:00","id":1031952,"title":"","content":"My storyteller kinda agree more on the psychich damage aswell, even though he doesn't know for sure either, guess i'll never know for sure too <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12871-elggur","name":"Elggur","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-14T21:17:49-08:00","id":1031970,"title":"","content":"Every other Patterning spell only takes 1 Reach to deal aggravated damage, so I'm guessing it's a typo no one caught. <br /> <br /> Oops.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-14T22:26:13-08:00","id":1031994,"title":"","content":"It could also be on purpose on an game-balance side of things since Mind attack spells are far less prone to Sleeper Witnesses and the drawbacks there-in than other Arcana that would be applied in the physical plane. But unless Dave says something, we can't really know. I'd default to keeping it myself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T02:04:36-08:00","id":1032049,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1031489-aggravated-damage-and-reach?p=1031994#post1031994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It could also be on purpose on an game-balance side of things since Mind attack spells are far less prone to Sleeper Witnesses and the drawbacks there-in than other Arcana that would be applied in the physical plane. But unless Dave says something, we can't really know. I'd default to keeping it myself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><sub>characters</sub></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T16:37:47-08:00","id":1032375,"title":"","content":"It might be a token game balance attempt for the fact that Mind mage can force you to suicide using a 2nd dot spell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}